ource":"tsk","text":"He saw Ephraimʼs sons to the third generation, and indeed the sons of Machir son of Manasseh were brought up on Josephʼs knees.","from":21},{"book":"EXO","chapter":31,"verse":2,"verseEnd":2,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"“See, I have called by name Bezalel son of Uri, the son of Hur, of the tribe of Judah.","from":20},{"book":"EXO","chapter":36,"verse":1,"verseEnd":2,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"“So Bezalel, Oholiab, and every skilled person are to carry out everything commanded by the LORD, who has given them skill and ability to know how to perform all the work of constructing the sanctuary.” Then Moses summoned Bezalel, Oholiab, and every skilled person whom the LORD had gifted—everyone whose heart stirred him to come and do the work.","from":20},{"book":"EXO","chapter":37,"verse":1,"verseEnd":1,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Bezalel went on to construct the ark of acacia wood, two and a half cubits long, a cubit and a half wide, and a cubit and a half high.","from":20},{"book":"EXO","chapter":38,"verse":22,"verseEnd":22,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Bezalel son of Uri, the son of Hur, of the tribe of Judah, made everything that the LORD had commanded Moses.","from":20},{"book":"NUM","chapter":26,"verse":29,"verseEnd":29,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"These were the descendants of Manasseh: The Machirite clan from Machir, the father of Gilead, and the Gileadite clan from Gilead.","from":21},{"book":"NUM","chapter":27,"verse":1,"verseEnd":1,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Now the daughters of Zelophehad son of Hepher, the son of Gilead, the son of Machir, the son of Manasseh, belonged to the clans of Manasseh son of Joseph. These were the names of his daughters: Mahlah, Noah, Hoglah, Milcah, and Tirzah. They approached","from":21},{"book":"NUM","chapter":32,"verse":39,"verseEnd":40,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"The descendants of Machir son of Manasseh went to Gilead, captured it, and drove out the Amorites who were there. So 