ud, and from Manasseh, Gamaliel son of Pedahzur;","from":41},{"book":"NUM","chapter":16,"verse":1,"verseEnd":1,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Now Korah son of Izhar, the son of Kohath son of Levi, along with some Reubenites—Dathan and Abiram, sons of Eliab, and On son of Peleth—conducted","from":33},{"book":"NUM","chapter":27,"verse":3,"verseEnd":4,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"“Our father died in the wilderness, but he was not among the followers of Korah who gathered together against the LORD. Instead, he died because of his own sin, and he had no sons. Why should the name of our father disappear from his clan because he had no sons? Give us property among our fatherʼs brothers.”","from":34},{"book":"NUM","chapter":27,"verse":8,"verseEnd":8,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Furthermore, you shall say to the Israelites, ‘If a man dies and leaves no son, you are to transfer his inheritance to his daughter.","from":34},{"book":"NUM","chapter":36,"verse":2,"verseEnd":2,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"saying, “When the LORD commanded my lord to give the land as an inheritance to the Israelites by lot, He also commanded him to give the inheritance of our brother Zelophehad to his daughters.","from":34},{"book":"NUM","chapter":36,"verse":10,"verseEnd":11,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"So the daughters of Zelophehad did as the LORD had commanded Moses. Mahlah, Tirzah, Hoglah, Milcah, and Noah, the daughters of Zelophehad, were married to cousins on their fatherʼs side.","from":34},{"book":"RUT","chapter":4,"verse":17,"verseEnd":17,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"The neighbor women said, “A son has been born to Naomi,” and they named him Obed. He became the father of Jesse, the father of David.","from":37},{"book":"2SA","chapter":23,"verse":26,"verseEnd":26,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Helez the Paltite, Ira son of Ikkesh the Tekoite,","from":39}],"notes":[],"groups":[]},"42-55":{"people":[{"id":"caleb-h3612h","name":"Caleb","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Hezr